    ('read', 'At lunch, a crowd of students has gathered at the door of the Defence classroom. Professor Ashgrove is showing them his paintings: landscapes, old wizards, a ship in a storm. He tells a story for every one. Everybody is laughing. In the back row of frames, one portrait is not.'),
