    ('p', '<b>Appears:</b> a Dueling Club rival in the Great Hall (leaves at the end of the block), and the second rune tablet in the Greenhouses.'),
    ('say', 'Professor Flitwick', '“Dueling Club! Every evening in the Great Hall. Fair fights, friendly spells, nobody gets stunned into next week. Well. Rarely.”'),
