    ('read', 'A crowd at the Library door. The librarian is white with shock. Slumped against the shelves, a book still open in her lap, is a fourth-year girl. Grey, all of her. The portraits in this corridor are silent too, and one of them has a smear of fresh paint across its frame, as if something climbed out in a hurry.'),
