    ('read', 'Professor Scamander is waiting outside the old gamekeeper’s hut with a battered suitcase at her feet. Every so often, the suitcase thumps. “Creatures are not dangerous,” she says. “People who do not understand them are dangerous. Today we learn to understand.”'),
    ('gm', 'Start the class minigame (Befriend the Beast). Passing gives two Creature treats and 10 XP.'),
